WEBVTT

00:05:59.413 --> 00:06:02.079
that pits schools and neighborhoods
against one another,

00:06:02.121 --> 00:06:05.871
get rid of rating systems
and budgeting formulas

00:06:05.871 --> 00:06:07.704
that punish kids for their zip codes

00:06:07.746 --> 00:06:11.163
in a city that's been segregated
since its inception.

00:06:12.454 --> 00:06:14.288
The fight for equity in Chicago

00:06:14.329 --> 00:06:17.079
did not become life or death
in the pandemic --

00:06:17.121 --> 00:06:19.371
it's been life or death
for a long time now.

00:06:19.913 --> 00:06:22.746
We need to care
about other people's children,

00:06:22.746 --> 00:06:25.038
and not just as data points
alongside our own.

00:06:26.829 --> 00:06:29.496
Third, we need to support
the whole student.